"Kundalini,","start":437.4,"end":437.96},{"text":"please","start":437.96,"end":438.22},{"text":"take","start":438.22,"end":438.6},{"text":"these","start":438.6,"end":438.98},{"text":"external","start":438.98,"end":439.28},{"text":"things","start":439.28,"end":439.62},{"text":"away,","start":439.62,"end":440.52}]},{"text":"these superficial ideas, because it is not me.","start":440.52,"end":447.92,"words":[{"text":"these","start":440.52,"end":440.78},{"text":"superficial","start":440.78,"end":441.28},{"text":"ideas,","start":441.28,"end":442.56},{"text":"because","start":446.62,"end":446.76},{"text":"it","start":446.76,"end":447},{"text":"is","start":447,"end":447.18},{"text":"not","start":447.18,"end":447.32},{"text":"me.","start":447.32,"end":447.92}]},{"text":"Here inside we can say, I forgive everyone and I forgive myself.","start":476.6,"end":482.36,"words":[{"text":"Here","start":476.6,"end":476.82},{"text":"inside","start":476.82,"end":477.02},{"text":"we","start":477.02,"end":477.26},{"text":"can","start":477.26,"end":477.44},{"text":"say,","start":477.44,"end":478.18},{"text":"I","start":479.68,"end":479.82},{"text":"forgive","start":479.82,"end":480.12},{"text":"everyone","start":480.12,"end":480.66},{"text":"and","start":480.66,"end":481.36},{"text":"I","start":481.36,"end":481.52},{"text":"forgive","start":481.52,"end":481.72},{"text":"myself.","start":481.72,"end":482.36}]},{"text":"We can raise our hand on top of our head and we can gently massage it clockwise,","start":512.32,"end":519.38,"words":[{"text":"We","start":512.32,"end":512.48},{"text":"can","start":512.48,"end":512.64},{"text":"raise","start":512.64,"end":512.82},{"text":"our","start":512.82,"end":513.04},{"text":"hand","start":513.04,"end":513.22},{"text":"on","start":513.22,"end":513.3},{"text":"top","start":513.3,"end":513.44},{"text":"of","start":513.44,"end":513.66},{"text":"our","start":513.66,"end":513.76},{"text":"head","start":513.76,"end":514.04},{"text":"and","start":517.06,"end":517.36},{"text":"we","start":517.36,"end":517.42},{"text":"can","start":517.42,"end":517.58},{"text":"gently","start":517.58,"end":517.76},{"text":"massage","start":517.76,"end":518.22},{"text":"it","start":518.22,"end":518.44},{"text":"clockwise,","start":518.44,"end":519.38}]},{"text":"pressing down quite firmly.","start":519.62,"end":521.2,"words":[{"text":"pressing","start":519.62,"end":519.96},{"text":"down","start":519.96,"end":520.28},{"text":"quite","start":520.28,"end":520.48},{"text":"firmly.","start":520.48,"end":521.2}]},{"text":"Mother Kundalini, please awaken on top of my head.","start":543.12,"end":545.5,"words":[{"text":"Mother","start":543.12,"end":543.4},{"text":"Kundalini,","start":543.4,"end":544.16},{"text":"please","start":544.16,"end":544.16},{"text":"awaken","start":544.16,"end":544.64},{"text":"on","start":544.64,"end":544.86},{"text":"top","start":544.86,"end":545},{"text":"of","start":545,"end":545.24},{"text":"my","start":545.24,"end":545.24},{"text":"head.","start":545.24,"end":545.5}]},{"text":"Let me feel your guiding light of love and let that love guide me to be the self-confident person that I am and nothing else.","start":551.58,"end":566.06,"words":[{"text":"Let","start":551.58,"end":551.82},{"text":"me","start":551.82,"end":552.02},{"text":"feel","start":552.02,"end":552.22},{"text":"your","start":552.22,"end":552.48},{"text":"guiding","start":552.48,"end":552.76},{"text":"light","start":552.76,"end":553.1},{"text":"of","start":553.1,"end":553.34},{"text":"love","start":553.34,"end":553.74},{"text":"and","start":557.12,"end":557.42},{"text":"let","start":557.42,"end":557.64},{"text":"that","start":557.64,"end":557.86},{"text":"love","start":557.86,"end":558.32},{"text":"guide","start":558.32,"end":558.8},{"text":"me","start":558.8,"end":559.02},{"text":"to","start":559.02,"end":559.22},{"text":"be","start":559.22,"end":559.58},{"text":"the","start":560.92,"end":561.34},{"text":"self-confident","start":561.34,"end":562.1},{"text":"person","start":562.1,"end":562.92},{"text":"that","start":563.16,"end":563.46},{"text":"I","start":563.46,"end":563.52},{"text":"am","start":563.52,"end":563.92},{"text":"and","start":564.88,"end":565.22},{"text":"nothing","start":565.22,"end":565.44},{"text":"else.","start":565.44,"end":566.06}]},{"text":"Let me only be that which I am.","start":568.76,"end":571.68,"words":[{"text":"Let","start":568.76,"end":568.9},{"text":"me","start":568.9,"end":569.28},{"text":"only","start":569.28,"end":569.54},{"text":"be","start":569.54,"end":569.74},{"text":"that","start":569.74,"end":570.1},{"text":"which","start":570.58,"end":570.96},{"text":"I","start":570.96,"end":571.14},{"text":"am.","start":571.14,"end":571.68}]},{"text":"We can place our hand back down on our lap and again we can sit with our back straight with full dignity and full confidence that this meditation will make me a more confident person.","start":591.1,"end":611.94,"words":[{"text":"We","start":591.1,"end":591.12},{"text":"can","start":591.12,"end":591.26},{"text":"place","start":591.26,"end":591.5},{"text":"our","start":591.5,"end":591.7},{"text":"hand","start":591.7,"end":591.86},{"text":"back","start":591.86,"end":592.08},{"text":"down","start":592.08,"end":592.32},{"text":"on","start":592.32,"end":592.56},{"text":"our","start":592.56,"end":592.62},{"text":"lap","start":592.62,"end":592.92},{"text":"and","start":594.96,"end":595.32},{"text":"again","start":595.32,"end":595.54},{"text":"we","start":595.54,"end":595.68},{"text":"can","start":595.68,"end":595.92},{"text":"sit","start":595.92,"end":596.2},{"text":"with","start":596.2,"end":596.42},{"text":"our","start":596.42,"end":596.58},{"text":"back","start":596.58,"end":596.8},{"text":"straight","start":596.8,"end":597.1},{"text":"with","start":597.1,"end":597.72},{"text":"full","start":599.72,"end":599.98},{"text":"dignity","start":599.98,"end":600.32},{"text":"and","start":600.32,"end":601.1},{"text":"full","start":602.98,"end":603.24},{"text":